<title>USA: Nabisco Holdings Corp Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Nabisco Holdings Corp Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.41		    $0.44</p>
<p> Net			110,000		  116,000</p>
<p> Sales		  2,483,000		2,350,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 267,770		  265,644</p>
<p>			  YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.06		    $1.13</p>
<p> Net			 17,000		  295,000</p>
<p> Sales		  8,889,000		8,294,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 267,016		  261,717</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 net includes $70 million in restructurng related expenses.</p>
<p>Yr 1996 net includes $428 restructuring charge and $97 million in other restructuring related expenses.</p>
<p>1996 shr excluding restrucutring charges is $0.56 in Q4 and $1.40 for year.</p>
<p>Yr 1995 net includes $0.07/shr charge for early extinguishment of debt.</p>
